Control words
Word	Description
where	the work that follows is done only where its condition holds
for each	the work that follows is done once for each item, in order
until	the work that follows is done again until its condition holds
refused	the access ends with the error named, its reason given
give	the access ends, giving the value named
end the access	an error that ends an access program called is handled as the requirement says
